      "comment": "The {S} symbol is a generic mana symbol. It represents a cost that can be paid by one mana that was produced by a snow source. That mana can be any color or colorless."
    },
    {
      "oracle_id": "5b2460a5-6ae5-4cad-ba94-1a9e98e6e4c0",
